  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;</p><p>For angle to be acute&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Since&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, so&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>48</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;but&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>&#981;</mi></math></p></blockquote>"
